      "type": "closed_single",
      "points": 2,
      "topics": [
        "ułamki"
      ],
      "prompt_html": "<p>Wynikiem działania: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>)</mo><mo>·</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>)</mo><mo>·</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>)</mo><mo>·</mo><mo>…</mo><mo>·</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2018</mn></mfrac><mo>)</mo><mo>·</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2019</mn></mfrac><mo>)</mo></math> jest liczba</p>",
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": "A",
          "html": "niewymierna"
        },
        {
          "label": "B",
          "html": "wymierna, lecz nie całkowita"
        },
        {
          "label": "C",
          "html": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2019</mn></mfrac><mo>)</mo><mo>·</mo><mn>2019</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn></math>"
        },
        {
          "label": "D",
          "html": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2019</mn></mfrac><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>·</mo><mn>2019</mn></math>"
        }
      ],
      "figures": [],
      "answer": {
        "correct": null,
        "solution_html": null,
        "model": {
          "answer": "C",
          "by": "sonnet",
          "agrees": null,
          "solution_html": "<p>Każdy czynnik (1+1/k)=(k+1)/k dla k=2,...,2019, więc iloczyn teleskopuje: (3/2)(4/3)...(2020/2019) = 2020/2 = 1010.</p><p>Sprawdzamy C: (1+1/2019)·2019:2 = (2020/2019)·(2019/2) = 2020/2 = 1010 — zgadza się z wynikiem.</p>"
        }
      }
    },
    {
